/target
# Isolated CARGO_TARGET_DIR used when several agents build this crate at once,
# so a shared target does not hand one of them a stale rlib.
/target-*
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
.idea/
.vscode/

# Investigation output, not sources. `evidence/` is 46 MB of run logs, probe
# JSON and decompiled third-party assemblies; a pack's `metadata/` is 25 MB
# that `e3d-descriptor compile-metadata` regenerates. Both are cheap to
# reproduce and permanent once they enter history.
/evidence
/metadata
schema/*/metadata/
/.context

# Build output of the runtime UDA exporter, rebuilt from its own source.
tools/e3d/*.dll
__pycache__/
